## Design premise

The central hypothesis is that readmission prevention should be shifted from “more work during the index hospitalization” to:

1. automated detection of unresolved transition risks;
2. task delegation to pharmacists, community health workers, navigators, and centralized teams;
3. asynchronous post-discharge support;
